<div id="A2.SS0.SSS0.Px2.p2" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A2.SS0.SSS0.Px2.p2.1" class="ltx_p">Figure <a href="#A2.F5" title="Figure 5 ‣ Result comparison ‣ Appendix B Comparison with Training-Free Methods ‣ Universal Few-Shot Spatial Control for Diffusion Models" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">5</span></a> presents qualitative comparisons. UFC accurately follows the spatial condition, while FreeControl and Ctrl-X fail on fine details control.</p>
</div>
<figure id="A2.F5" class="ltx_figure"><img src="2509.07530v1/ctrlx.png" id="A2.F5.g1" class="ltx_graphics ltx_centering ltx_img_square" style="aspect-ratio:476/429;" width="476" height="429" alt="Refer to caption">
